extends layoutBasic
block title
  title Invalid invitation
block content
  h1 Invalid invitation
  p The invitation you have clicked on is not valid. Please request a new one from the mentor team in slack.
  p
    i NOTE: invitations expire after they are used. If you did not use this invitation, someone else may have. Please contact the mentor team ASAP if this has happened. If you are trying to reset your password, use the password reset form on the #[a(href="/login") login page].
